<title>PORTUGAL: Portuguese bonds retreat, follow Bunds.</title>
<headline>Portuguese bonds retreat, follow Bunds.</headline>
<text>
<p>1700 GMT - Bonds closed lower, taking their lead from the Bunds. Traders said the market could ease further on Wednesday as it awaits U.S. inflation figures later in the day.</p>
<p>*Sept 97 futures drop 41 to 110.38 vs Monday close</p>
<p>*Feb 07 cash (OTC) 102.05 vs 102.40. Yld 6.33 vs 6.28</p>
<p>*Spread vs 10-yr cash Bund 70 vs same</p>
</text>
